# An allow list: only what the image needs is sent to the build, so nothing private can ever be copied in, such as
# .env (the API keys), data/ (the SQLite catalog, with Gamalytic's and TwitchTracker's figures, which may not be
# shared, and any saved password files), .venv/, .git/ or reporting/ (Power BI, local only).
*
!requirements.txt
!game_librarian/
!curated/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
